WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
You are Eames.

00:02.400 --> 00:07.000
Inside the dream, Fischer has reached his father's bedside.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.400
In this encounter, he cannot remember the combination.

00:13.100 --> 00:16.600
The number belongs to an earlier memory.

00:16.600 --> 00:20.000
Help him remember before the dream collapses.
